        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cooke-clock-and-wavefront-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-clock-and-wavefront-audit-cooke-clock-and-wavefront-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-clock-and-wavefront-audit-cooke-clock-and-wavefront-2>,
