<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cooke-clock-and-wavefront-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooke & Zeeman (1976) clock-and-wavefront somite segmentation — MorphoEval overall 58.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `1976-cooke-clock-and-wavefront.py` (58.4/100). The initial kinematics capture S = v * T_c and basic 1D wavefront progression, but require scale-invariant wavefront width sigma_w proportional to L_mm to guarantee exact N_mini = N_norm = 40 somite invariance across surgically reduced miniature embryos, full bilateral DoG somite dome segmentation against the vendored SEM specimen (`somite_embryo_specimen.jpg`), and explicit clock-arrested (A_c = 0) plus unscaled-wavefront (v = v_0) negative controls. Overall 58.1/100 (faithfulness 56.1, reproducibility 62.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 52, Parameter expressivity 58, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/clock_and_wavefront_comparison.png: rendered output of 1976-cooke-clock-and-wavefront.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1215618 B, 2310×1372 px, artifact_sha256 1db23a76c4cc9d4544515fc51d9b8e774a6986c84596f4234ab2cf361bf10101 (sha256 1db23a76c4cc9d4544515fc51d9b8e774a6986c84596f4234ab2cf361bf10101), spec_fingerprint 9a567843f2a6020e93562e6d7e58c2b8167adcb8c6b198fb2164e03a085e6bb6. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 9a567843f2a6020e93562e6d7e58c2b8167adcb8c6b198fb2164e03a085e6bb6; artifact_sha256: 1db23a76c4cc9d4544515fc51d9b8e774a6986c84596f4234ab2cf361bf10101; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/clock_and_wavefront/clock_and_wavefront_reference.json=4851550f4179ae63..., datasets/clock_and_wavefront/scout_manifest.json=0beabd3277c705e6..., datasets/clock_and_wavefront/somite_embryo_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak & inter-somitic cleft segmentation on `datasets/clock_and_wavefront/somite_embryo_specimen.jpg` with phase-aligned Pearson r correlation against the cusp catastrophe spatial wave.",
        "remediation needed: Include both a clock-arrested negative control (A_clock = 0 -> 0 somites) and an unscaled-wavefront failure control (v = v_0 across reduced L) alongside the 5 Cooke (1975) experimental regimes.",
        "remediation needed: Scale wavefront transition width sigma_w proportionally to axial length L (sigma_w = 0.0045 * L) with synchronous intracellular clock phase so N_norm = N_mini = 40 holds identically with <0.2% wavelength error." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.81e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

